[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0406","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0406.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0710","title":"Squid cachemgr.cgi 未授权代理连接漏洞","description":"Squid 代理服务器在 Red Hat Linux 5.2/6.0 等发行版中默认将 cachemgr.cgi 脚本安装于公开 Web 目录下，且未对访问来源进行有效限制。远程攻击者无需任何身份认证即可利用该 CGI 脚本作为中间代理转发连接请求，从而绕过目标网络的访问控制策略，实现内网探测、隐藏攻击来源或作为跳板对外发起攻击。该漏洞影响范围广泛，仅需目标开放 HTTP 服务即可利用，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0710"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"1999-07-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:53Z","remediation":"升级 squid 至 Red Hat RHSA-1999-025 对应修复版本，或将 cachemgr.cgi 移出 Web 公开目录（如 /usr/lib/cgi-bin/）。在 Apache 配置中为 cachemgr.cgi 添加访问控制，仅允许受信管理 IP 访问：<Location /cachemgr.cgi> Order deny,allow; Deny from all; Allow from 192.168.0.0/16 </Location>。如无需远程管理功能，直接删除 cachemgr.cgi 文件。Debian 用户应升级至 DSA-576 对应版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://fedoranews.org/updates/FEDORA--.shtml","http://www.debian.org/security/2004/dsa-576","http://www.redhat.com/archives/fedora-announce-list/2005-May/msg00025.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-1999-025.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2005-489.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/archives/rh52-errata-general.html#squid","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2059","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2385","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20465","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/1999/CVE-1999-0710.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0710.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0710","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/s/squid/squid.spec","https://github.com/squid-cache/squid/blob/6f4c814b8181c38c56be817f2d339936b63b408f/ChangeLog","https://github.com/grafeas/grafeas/blob/448cd756a92f62111ecf96509c66267421396826/go/v1beta1/storage/testobjects.go","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0710.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0710.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/fedora_2005-373.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qhrx-x4p7-jr4j/GHSA-qhrx-x4p7-jr4j.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0406.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0406.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0406.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0014","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0014.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0224","title":"Microsoft Windows NT Messenger Service 长用户名拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 Messenger 服务在解析超长用户名时存在边界处理缺陷，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可向目标系统发送特制的超长用户名数据包，触发服务崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞利用方式简单，攻击者无需复杂工具即可通过标准网络协议发包实施攻击，影响 Windows NT 4.0 全版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0224"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1999-07-23T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:56Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 针对 Windows NT 4.0 的 Service Pack 5 (SP5) 或更高版本，该补丁修复了 Messenger Service 对畸形用户名处理不当的问题。对于已停止支持的旧系统，建议升级至 Windows Server 2003 或更高版本；若无法升级，可在服务管理器中禁用 \"Messenger\" 服务以消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0224","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/329","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/1999/CVE-1999-0224.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ead50dc12e50bdd7f50b53d9d01c9f9946862c44/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0224.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0224","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/36c16d53eb6071e39cfc3cf88e99f1b340ec913b/data/year/1999.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ed191c1149de50e461e9a357f4a3a22e603f0d1/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0224.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0224.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0224.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153500_153600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0014.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0994","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0994.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1165","title":"GNU fingerd 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"GNU fingerd 1.37 存在权限管理缺陷，程序在访问用户信息前未正确放弃特权。本地攻击者可利用该漏洞通过两种方式实施攻击：一是在 .fingerrc 文件中放置恶意程序以获取 root 权限；二是利用 .plan、.forward 或 .project 文件中的符号链接读取系统任意文件。该漏洞影响运行 GNU fingerd 1.37 的系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。建议升级至最新版本或禁用 finger 服务。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1165"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-07-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:51Z","remediation":"建议立即禁用或卸载 finger 服务（如 `systemctl disable fingerd` 或 `apt remove fingerd`），该服务已过时且存在权限提升风险。如业务必须使用，应升级至修复了提权问题的版本，并确保 .fingerrc/.plan/.forward/.project 文件仅属主可写，同时以非 root 用户运行 fingerd 进程。作为临时缓解，可通过 `chmod 0 /usr/sbin/fingerd` 移除执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93268249021561&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/2478","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/535","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1d6385d398a2a41185d3cc14943c25f73c724ba3/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1165.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1165","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1165.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/baa4573f2fa6813cfbc3f5cda2f1796a92d64bdf/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1165.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/95e6ff620d5494b93ba2234edfcf6a45187dc0a8/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mgmg-j29c-p5ff/GHSA-mgmg-j29c-p5ff.json","https://github.com/illuusio/freebsd-osv/blob/3234f9e67d0170ff9c6cada9a1f48f061b109728/md/2007/FreeBSD-2007-0146.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/535/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1165.json","https://github.com/freebsd/freebsd-ports-gnome/blob/404a8a3dcfe44008a77681798d15e6d43285f73a/security/vuxml/vuln-2007.xml","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153500_153600.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0994.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0808","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0808.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0810","title":"Samba 2.0.5 nmbd NETBIOS名称服务守护进程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Samba 2.0.5 版本的 NETBIOS 名称服务守护进程（nmbd）存在拒绝服务漏洞。该漏洞源于 nmbd 在处理特制的 NETBIOS 名称服务请求报文时，未能对输入进行充分校验，导致进程崩溃或进入异常状态。攻击者可向运行 nmbd 的服务器发送精心构造的恶意 UDP 数据包（目标端口通常为 137），远程触发服务不可用。影响范围涵盖使用 Samba 2.0.5 并启用 nmbd 进行 NetBIOS 名称解析与浏览服务的主机，攻击无需身份认证，属于远程可触发的拒绝服务。利用方式即向目标 nmbd 端口发送畸形名称服务请求，使其资源耗尽或崩溃，从而导致局域网内名称解析与浏览服务中断。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0810"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-07-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:06Z","remediation":"升级到 Samba 2.0.5a 或更高版本（推荐 2.0.7）。如无法立即升级，请在防火墙中限制 UDP 137/138 端口仅对可信内网开放，并移除 smb.conf 中所有 message command 配置行，然后重启 nmbd 服务使修复生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0810","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73dad9db65989a09e468a4f3a98f0eea36f0346c/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0810.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0810","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/8854c056beab250ba690e2bcc8887feb4c1f8139/1999/CVE-1999-0810/README.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0810.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/57cb981038a97031bd95a35a9b10bbed18ca4725/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0810.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/90b464bbc2d1b64270a5771429f96b67fbe9e79b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vfc2-4x6j-g8gr/GHSA-vfc2-4x6j-g8gr.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/134977c5f4ce4f427a914ca161b4f075e34b560b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0810.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--1c9eefb7-c050-43f6-af93-f95b6108af67.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/1999/19990804.data"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0808.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0575","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0575.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0811","title":"Samba smbd 畸形消息命令缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Samba 是一款在 Linux/Unix 系统上实现 SMB/CIFS 协议的开源文件与打印共享服务软件。其核心守护进程 smbd 在处理客户端发送的畸形消息命令（message command）时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可构造超长或格式异常的消息命令数据包发送至开放 139/445 端口的 smbd 服务，触发栈缓冲区溢出，从而导致服务崩溃拒绝服务，在特定条件下甚至可执行任意代码并获得系统权限。该漏洞无需认证即可利用，威胁范围覆盖 2.0.5 之前的多个 Samba 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0811"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-07-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:06Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Samba 到 2.0.5 或更高版本，该版本已修复 smbd 程序处理畸形消息命令时的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法立即升级，应通过防火墙限制对 139/445 端口的访问，仅允许可信主机连接 SMB 服务，并在 smb.conf 中配置 hosts allow 白名单以减小攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/536","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19428","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73dad9db65989a09e468a4f3a98f0eea36f0346c/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0811.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0811","https://github.com/entrysky/mageni/blob/c58dcc9bc43b7fb267bb10a8083ada356fbc81d1/plugins/2020/samba/gb_samba_CVE-1999-0811.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0811.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5297adfba5e91ee22e711c26c523b292d427c0d0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0811.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/90b464bbc2d1b64270a5771429f96b67fbe9e79b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c55w-jx2c-3c8x/GHSA-c55w-jx2c-3c8x.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/exploit.rules","https://github.com/jbeasl7/openvas-feed-sync-local/blob/fb27339bf790f38603dcf52a87a4652cadb30c7e/openvas-feeds/nvt-feed/2020/samba/gb_samba_CVE-1999-0811.nasl","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/134977c5f4ce4f427a914ca161b4f075e34b560b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0811.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0575.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1054","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1054.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1338","title":"Delegate proxy 权限许可漏洞","description":"Delegate proxy 5.9.3 及更早版本在 DGROOT 目录中创建文件和目录时设置了全局可写权限，导致本地攻击者可以修改或删除这些文件，可能造成权限提升或拒绝服务。攻击者需要具有本地系统访问权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1338"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-07-21T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级至 Delegate 5.9.4 或更高版本，该版本已修复文件/目录权限问题。如无法升级，在启动脚本中设置 umask 022 限制新建文件权限，并将 DGROOT 指向非 /tmp 的安全目录（如 /var/delegate），然后以 root 身份执行 chmod -R g-w,o-w $DGROOT 修正已有目录的权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93259112204664&w=2"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1054.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-01338","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-01338.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1338","title":"DeleGate 代理服务器 DGROOT 目录权限许可漏洞","description":"DeleGate 代理 5.9.3 及更早版本在 DGROOT 目录中创建的文件和目录具有全局可写权限，导致本地用户可修改或删除敏感文件","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1338"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-07-21T00:00:00Z","updated":"2024-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到 Delegate proxy 5.9.4 或更高版本，或手动修复 DGROOT 目录权限","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93259112204664&w=2"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-01338.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1986","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1986.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1535","title":"The user wants me to generate a `title` field for the vulnerability CVE-1999-1535. Let me analyze the known information: - Vendor: Persits Software - Product: AspUpload - Vulnerability type: 缓冲区溢出 (Buffer Overflow) - Impact: Denial of Service, possibly remote code execution The title format should be: \"厂商 产品 漏洞类型\" (Chinese) So: \"Persits Software AspUpload 缓冲区溢出漏洞\" Let me make it more specific and follow the format better. The example shows \"Microsoft Windows TCP/IP 远程代码执行漏洞\" - vendor + product + vulnerability type. For this one: - 厂商: Persits Software - 产品: AspUpload - 漏洞类型: 缓冲区溢出 So: \"Persits Software AspUpload 缓冲区溢出漏洞\" - this is 18 chars, meets the 20-100 requirement... actually let me count Chinese chars: Persits Software AspUpload 缓冲区溢出漏洞 = that's ~22 Chinese chars equivalent. The original title from AVD is \"aspupload 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞\". Let me refine it to be more descriptive. The NVD description says it allows remote attackers to cause denial of service and possibly execute arbitrary commands. So it could be \"Persits Software AspUpload 缓冲区溢出导致远程","description":"Persits Software AspUpload 组件中的 AspUpload.dll 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 HTTP 请求中提交超长参数触发该漏洞，导致目标系统发生拒绝服务，甚至可能执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 AspUpload 1.4.0.2 之前的所有版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1535"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-07-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:39Z","remediation":"升级 Persits AspUpload 至 1.4.0.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 AspUpload.dll 中缓冲区长度检查缺陷。如无法升级，在 IIS 中配置 URLScan 或类似工具，限制 HTTP 请求参数长度不超过合理阈值，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=93256878011447&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=93501427820328&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/592","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3291","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/148999c8327bd04fe7e0fdad6195adf7b36060c6/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1535.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1535","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/1999/CVE-1999-1535/README.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1535.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84a8576323536424cfe4fe56907ba66e1ea3a744/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1535.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9a3495eb833b3f1f2096187c4b14884afc98b67a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xc8q-qrg6-rp5r/GHSA-xc8q-qrg6-rp5r.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153500_153600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1535.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000701.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1986.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1986.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1183","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1183.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1560","title":"Texas A&M University Tiger 本地命令执行漏洞","description":"Texas A&M University 开发的 Tiger 安全审计工具中，某个脚本存在输入验证不足漏洞。本地攻击者可通过构造特制命令参数，诱使该脚本以 Tiger 进程权限（通常为 root）执行任意命令，从而导致权限提升。该漏洞影响 Tiger 全版本，CVSS v2.0 评分 7.2，危害等级高危。厂商已发布补丁修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1560"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-07-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:43Z","remediation":"立即从 ftp://net.tamu.edu/pub/security/TAMU/ 下载并安装官方补丁；确保 Tiger 仅由受信任的 root 用户在受控环境中运行（如定时任务而非普通用户触发）；如无法获取补丁，建议彻底移除 Tiger 或禁用其特权执行权限，改用 lynis 等 modern 替代工具。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93252050203589&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2369","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e37edb84f090321c2ab4b4aefc57f84a75b1b940/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1560.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1560","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1560.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f73aeebc806b7ab5e9488498a056b9fa7bf30dd7/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1560.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f2hg-7qhr-2xhq/GHSA-f2hg-7qhr-2xhq.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87935/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1560.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153500_153600.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000702.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1183.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0408","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0408.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0721","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0/2000 Local Security Authority Subsystem 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 及 Windows 2000 系统的本地安全机构子系统（LSA）存在输入验证不当漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 LSA 请求报文，触发服务组件中的拒绝服务条件，导致 LSASS 进程崩溃、系统强制重启或域认证服务中断。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程触发，影响 Windows NT 4.0 和 Windows 2000 全版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0721"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-07-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:55Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 于 1999 年发布的安全更新 KB242607（Windows NT 4.0）或升级至 Windows 2000 Service Pack 1 及以上版本。由于 Windows NT 4.0 和 Windows 2000 已停止支持，建议升级至受支持的 Windows Server 版本（如 Windows Server 2019/2022）。临时缓解措施可在防火墙层面限制对 LSA 端口的未授权访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ231457","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/j-049.shtml","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-020","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/64d76d92cfbd9c4de4a352a59a2e52cadebc3afd/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0721.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0721","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0721.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2eb55660fa7a900eec90103b031be5d6f98d9ec/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0721.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1dbd44058e428445290bfb1f6fc6ecc0addbfd35/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hr94-mwmh-6848/GHSA-hr94-mwmh-6848.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153500_153600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/178b809924783e13787d17bb1b1fd55ad3b8639b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0721.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0408.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1683","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1683.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1011","title":"Microsoft IIS MDAC RDS DataFactory 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"该漏洞存在于微软数据访问组件（MDAC）2.1中的远程数据服务（RDS）DataFactory组件中，该组件在IIS 3.x和4.x版本中暴露了不安全的调用方法。通过向目标系统发送特定的RDS请求，攻击者可以绕过权限验证，直接利用这些不安全的方法来执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响包括Microsoft IIS 3.0/4.0、Microsoft Index Server 2.0和Microsoft Site Server Commerce Edition 3.0等服务，能够在完全未授权的情况下实现远程代码执行。攻击者只需向目标服务器发送精心构造的RDS数据包，即可接管目标主机控制权，危害等级极高。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1011"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-07-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:31Z","remediation":"立即升级 MDAC 至 2.5 SP3 或更高版本（含 MDAC 2.6/2.7/2.8），或升级 IIS 至 5.0 及以上版本；若无法升级，请在 IIS 中禁用 RDS（删除 /msadc 虚拟目录、移除 msadcs.dll 注册表项、禁用 ADC/ADO/ADO MDAC 组件），并在防火墙层面封禁 TCP 80/443 端口对外暴露的 RDS 端点。立即应用微软安全公报 MS99-025 提供的补丁程序（MDAC 2.1 SP2 补丁 / IIS 4.0 补丁包）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/j-054.shtml","http://www.osvdb.org/272","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1998/ms98-004","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-025","https://www.securityfocus.com/bid/529","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19424","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9a9b6476a3f4a52ffa21ec6ed80d737eb0fc242b/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1011.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1011","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/8854c056beab250ba690e2bcc8887feb4c1f8139/1999/CVE-1999-1011/README.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/ffab8835dab57629dd708bbd389c0fd0b4f23ace/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1011.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a6f1dc1488b4a75cccf07339e6a0f0ab45fc38ad/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1011.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/msadcs_dll.nasl","https://github.com/swimlane/soc-faker/blob/361c4ae88956878fbd8aaf5975044328556dfecd/socfaker/data/alert_names.txt","https://github.com/decal/werdlists/blob/81edb463f7f6311c85defefaf75ac9cd58e5cfb9/exploit-info/symantec-attack-signatures.txt","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/xerror/parsing/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1683.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1683.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1683.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1092","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1092.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1378","title":"dbmlparser.exe CGI留言本程序任意文件读取漏洞","description":"dbmlparser.exe CGI 留言簿程序未正确执行 chroot 操作，导致目录隔离失效。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用路径遍历技术，通过特制 HTTP 请求读取服务器上任意文件，包括系统配置文件、密码文件等敏感信息。该漏洞影响早期使用 dbmlparser.exe 的 CGI 留言簿应用，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。建议升级至修复版本或禁用该 CGI 程序。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1378"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-07-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:18Z","remediation":"立即从 Web 服务器的 CGI 目录中移除 dbmlparser.exe 程序文件，或删除其可执行权限（chmod -x），彻底禁用该 CGI 组件。由于该软件已停止维护多年，不存在官方补丁，如需留言板功能请迁移至现代受支持的替代方案（如 PHP 实现的留言本）。临时缓解措施可在 Web 服务器配置中针对该脚本路径添加访问控制规则（如 Apache 的 <Files> 或 <Location> 指令限制 IP 白名单），或在应用层对 DBMLFILE 参数进行路径过滤，拒绝包含 \"../\" 等目录遍历字符的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93250710625956&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/36911ad057245f7d02822794db0f459d9b4c9b8f/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1378.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1378","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1378.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3012e5f1cf9bcfe839897275a956236aed334269/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1378.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/664f1b641010bd1f3bc1d11a60ca29d1f4a0e4ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5g2p-8vh6-3w48/GHSA-5g2p-8vh6-3w48.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1378.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153500_153600.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000700.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8108bbe4fb0e20671face287a302a062844c09bb/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1092.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0306","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0306.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0692","title":"Silicon Graphics IRIX Array Services daemon 认证绕过远程权限提升漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX（UNICOS）系统中 Array Services 守护进程（arrayd）的默认配置禁用了身份认证机制。未经身份验证的远程攻击者可以连接到目标系统的 arrayd 服务，利用该认证缺陷获取系统 root 权限，从而完全控制受影响的主机。该漏洞影响运行 Array Services 的 SGI IRIX/UNICOS 系统，攻击者无需任何凭据即可在远程执行特权操作，危害等级严重，CVSS 评分为 10.0。SGI 已在 1999 年 7 月的安全公告中发布修复补丁，建议管理员立即升级 arrayd 并启用身份认证配置。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0692"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-07-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:51Z","remediation":"建议将 Array Services daemon (arrayd) 的认证机制配置为 AUTHENTICATION NOREMOTE 或启用 PRIVATE_NETWORK 认证，编辑 /usr/lib/array/arrayd.auth 配置文件启用身份验证，禁止默认无认证配置。同时升级 SGI IRIX/UNICOS 至厂商提供的修复版本，并通过防火墙限制 arrayd 服务端口（默认 5434/tcp）仅对可信主机开放。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/j-052.shtml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e2e66cc19cc703324c2947fd6e7687a8b094f9fa/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0692.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0692","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/a15a199bf04146bf147bbda699ab0c4915229daf/1999/CVE-1999-0692/README.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0692.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0f6f0e28732bc614273e91613aef04def1dce90b/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0692.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c137f5e2e6bb5d0d49e919ecf3efde0b10d9a781/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-g2hc-xmvw-hhph/GHSA-g2hc-xmvw-hhph.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0692.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--9e4ef6a4-48d0-4517-8dd9-a548963a1dd4.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0306.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1700","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1700.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1086","title":"Novell NetWare IPX 数据包签名绕过权限提升漏洞","description":"Novell NetWare 5 及更早版本在 IPX 协议上运行时，若数据包签名级别低于 3，存在会话伪骗漏洞。远程攻击者可通过伪造 IPC 分片数据包中的 MAC 地址，冒充合法用户发送 NetWare 核心协议（NCP）调用，从而获取管理员权限。该漏洞无需身份认证，攻击者仅需处于同一 IPX 网络段即可实施攻击，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1086"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-07-15T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:41Z","remediation":"将 Novell NetWare 的数据包签名级别（Packet Signature Level）设置为 3 或更高，以强制 NCP 通信使用签名验证。升级到 Novell NetWare 6 及以上版本。在网络层面，对 IPX 协议的 IPC 分片数据包启用源地址验证，并限制可信 MAC 地址的 IPX 流量。如不再需要 IPX 协议，建议迁移至 TCP/IP 协议栈并禁用 IPX。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93214475111651&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/528"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1700.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1152","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1152.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1518","title":"FreeBSD/NetBSD/Linux 共享内存 mmap/shmget 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"基于 BSD 4.4 代码实现的共享内存子系统存在设计缺陷，本地攻击者可通过调用 mmap 或 shmget 分配大量共享内存并触发页面错误，绕过系统资源限制（rlimits）导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD/NetBSD/Linux 等多种操作系统内核版本，攻击者无需特殊权限即可利用，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1518"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"1999-07-15T00:00:00Z","updated":"1999-07-15T00:00:00Z","remediation":"对于 FreeBSD 3.2 及更早版本，应用内核补丁使 mmap/shmget 系统调用检查 RLIMIT_AS 限制；对于 NetBSD 1.4 及更早版本，升级至 NetBSD 1.4.1 或更高版本；对于 Linux 2.3 及更早版本，安装 util-linux-2.9o 或更高版本并配置地址空间限制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93207728118694&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/526","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2351","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19423"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1152.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1152.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1152.toml"}]